# Java Spring Boot Standards

- Prefer constructor injection; avoid field injection
- Use records or immutable DTOs for API contracts where possible
{{#if parameters.layeredArchitecture}}
- Layering: controller → service → repository; no repository calls from controllers
- Domain exceptions mapped to HTTP status via `@ControllerAdvice`
{{/if}}
{{#if parameters.dtoValidation}}
- Validate request bodies with Jakarta Bean Validation (`@Valid`, `@NotNull`, etc.)
{{/if}}
- Externalize config via `application.yml`; profile-specific overrides for dev/prod
- Log structured context (request id, user id) at service boundaries
{{#if parameters.integrationTests}}
- Integration tests with `@SpringBootTest` + Testcontainers for databases
- Slice tests (`@WebMvcTest`, `@DataJpaTest`) for focused coverage
{{/if}}
